<title>FRANCE: France Telecom shortlists six ad agencies.</title>
<headline>France Telecom shortlists six ad agencies.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom said on Monday it had short-listed six advertising agencies to bid for consumer advertising for its upcoming initial public offering.</p>
<p>The competition will lead to selection of the agency in charge of creating and executing a campaign targeting individual investors in France in the run-up to the sale of a partial equity stake in France Telecom.</p>
<p>The six are Alice, BDDP, CLM, Devarrieux Villaret, FCA and Young &amp; Rubicam, it said in a statement. The winner will be announced in mid-January.</p>
</text>
